{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639","id":3577489448,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7VPCgo","number":1639,"title":"近小半年使用的一些感受","user":{"login":"atman233","id":52664034,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNjY0MDM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52664034?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233","html_url":"https://github.com/atman233","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atman233/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":16,"created_at":"2025-11-01T08:12:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T14:14:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"2025年5月开始接触trae\n在这之前使用过cursor   以及5月体验了一下阿里通义灵码\n当时给我的感受是trae的操作方式最符合我的使用直觉 感觉很用心的在设计交互 并且可以使用claude 遂大量使用 6月7月 两个账号开通月付高强度使用 给我的感觉还不错能让我在代码工作中轻松很多(有时候回答的不太好 是由于个人对话时细节描述不到位 一般我详细描述说明后都能够给我带来还不错的结果)\n\n转折点来了\n\n近期给我的体验很糟糕\n使用到现在 我个人在进行相对复杂的工程项目中都是基于文档来描述的\n我会将我的功能需求细节在文档中描述好  在对话中添加文档 进行处理 个人感觉相对于我一开始的粗糙的直接对话 我个人方面提升很多  按照我的预期来说 此时trae(claude4.0)应该能够更好的处理我的需求 但结果不是这样的 很多回答越来越牵强 给我的第一感觉就是 没有以前那么聪明了 不知道是模型的问题还是啥原因 如果是模型问题的话 claude4.5可以提供吗\n另一个就是期待了很久的solo模式  等待名单中待了几个月了  一点响动都没有  看了下issue貌似很多人都是这个情况  这是耍猴吗  还为此办了个年卡 想着这样子或许能够快点让我体验一下 现在发现是我想多了  感觉最近几个月的更新少了灵魂 更多的像是在做一个KPI产物\n\n写到这 其实就很希望能够得到一点答案\n后续可以用上相对正常的模型吗 啥时候可以用上\nsolo模式真的有在一点点的发放吗 哪怕是排个队 我也希望可以知道前方还有多少人\n现在这个项目真的变成了KPI产物了嘛 要是这样的话 可以提供年卡退款嘛  折半退也行的","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3478626871","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639#issuecomment-3478626871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639","id":3478626871,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7PV6I3","user":{"login":"yeah5500","id":241419328,"node_id":"U_kgDODmPEQA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241419328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeah5500","html_url":"https://github.com/yeah5500","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeah5500/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeah5500/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeah5500/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeah5500/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeah5500/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yeah5500/orgs","repos_url":"http