Z","body":"年卡用户失望，退钱！","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3478627412/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3479623437","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639#issuecomment-3479623437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1639","id":3479623437,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7PZtcN","user":{"login":"SinguJ","id":23053545,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDUzNTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23053545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ","html_url":"https://github.com/SinguJ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SinguJ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-03T09:29:30Z","updated_at":"2025-11-03T09:29:30Z","body":"我是因为 Cursor 用量用完了，按需付费又太贵，距离下个账期没几天才选择 Trae 的。\nTrae 的使用体验果然没让我失望，确实和我最初设想的一样糟糕。\n上下文管理一团糟，用户/项目规则完全不起效，啰哩啰嗦就是不干活，任务规划总是覆盖，文件修改一直失败。\n很多功能抄 Cursor 也没抄到位，属于是西施效颦了。\n最要命的是程序对系统资源的占用相当高，还时不时的卡死，感觉就是随便糊的屎山代码堆砌出来的产品。\n都 2025 年了，整个 GUI 还表现的跟个单线程似的，卡的我一度怀疑是在我电脑里跑的模型。\n除了界面比 Cursor 好看，真找不到任何优点。\n好在我只开了一个月的 Pro，算是花 $3 避雷了。","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/iss